# ADU bytes: the 7 byte MBAP header (transaction id, protocol id, length, unit id), then the PDU.
# A valid header declaring length 254 (an ADU of 260 bytes) followed by only 10 PDU bytes.
# The framer waits for the rest: decode returns Ok(None), the buffer is untouched and nothing is allocated for the missing 243 bytes.
00 01 00 00 00 FE 11 01 02 03 04 05 06 07 08 09 0A
